{"id":"dogadka","lemma":"догадка","pos":"noun","rank":4538,"glosses":["guess, conjecture, surmise; (plural) guesswork"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a8/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"догадки","plural":"догадки"},"examples":[{"text":"Это просто моя догадка.","en":"That's just my guess.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Это была всего лишь догадка.","en":"That was only a guess.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"only, no more than"]]},{"text":"Я не хочу строить догадки.","en":"I don't want to speculate.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to build, to construct"},null]},{"text":"Это всего лишь моя догадка.","en":"That's just my guess.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"only, no more than"]]},{"text":"Я бы не хотел строить какие-либо догадки.","en":"I wouldn't want to speculate.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to build, to construct"},null,{"g":"either ... or"},null]}]}